Mesa is an open-source implementation of OpenGL and related graphics APIs.
This NetBSD 11/AArch64 and amd64 source candidate selects classic VirGL,
V3D on AArch64, Iris on amd64, and softpipe/llvmpipe using shared LLVM 23, with
X11, Wayland, EGL, GBM, OpenGL and GLES. Package and native runtime acceptance
remain separate from source preparation.
